@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 2. Obtener resumen de impacto ambiental (en tiempo real)
GET {{baseUrl}}/impact/summary
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 3. Listar todos los componentes de hardware catalogados
GET {{baseUrl}}/components
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 4. Filtrar componentes disponibles para reparación o reuso
GET {{baseUrl}}/components?status=AVAILABLE&condition=REPAIRABLE
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5. Obtener detalle de un componente por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/components/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 6. Obtener trazabilidad e historial de un componente
GET {{baseUrl}}/components/1/traceability
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 7. Registrar / Catalogar nueva pieza de hardware
POST {{baseUrl}}/components
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Tarjeta Madre Gigabyte B550 AORUS Elite",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "donorId": 2,
  "brand": "Gigabyte",
  "model": "B550 AORUS Elite AX",
  "serialNumber": "SN-B550-77192",
  "conditionState": "REPAIRABLE",
  "weightKg": 1.15,
  "location": "Taller Guadalajara - Mesa 2",
  "specifications": {
    "socket": "AM4",
    "chipset": "AMD B550",
    "ramSlots": 4,
    "pcieSlots": 2
  },
  "notes": "Donado con problema de BIOS corrupta. Requiere flasheo con programador CH341A."
}

### 8. Listar reservas activas
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 9. Crear una nueva reserva de componente
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "componentId": 1,
  "requesterId": 3,
  "intendedUse": "REFURBISHMENT",
  "notes": "Solicitado para reparar y ensamblar PC de laboratorio estudiantil comunitario."
}

### 10. Actualizar estado de una reserva (Aprobar)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/1/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "notes": "Aprobada entrega en taller comunitario."
}

### 11. Autenticación - Login de demostración
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@ecoplaca.org",
  "password": "ecoplaca2026"
}
